### Create event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit-events
Authorization: Basic writer writer-change-me
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventType":"ACCOUNT_VIEWED","actorId":"EMP101","resourceType":"CLIENT_ACCOUNT","resourceId":"ACC5001","payload":{"operation":"VIEW","channel":"WEB"},"timestamp":"2026-10-27T10:30:00Z"}

### Query
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit-events?actorId=EMP101&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Basic reader reader-change-me

### Verify
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit-events/verify
Authorization: Basic admin admin-change-me

### Archive
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit-events/archive
Authorization: Basic admin admin-change-me
Content-Type: application/json

{"cutoff":"2027-10-27T00:00:00Z","requestedBy":"AUDIT_ADMIN","reason":"Retention policy"}
